", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_1840524873122821_3055739933188055904_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2OOGaT130noQ7kNvwHnU7Vq&_nc_oc=AdoMrAZHNoDQdYSGGMIDrCOW-2FX5Kowb5nh70wKXu9xz3anajXKUzN0X2pIqs5T1OY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6GXYxXcSYTU2qErzqRV6axFu6TV0Ui__S1xBZUw0MMRg&oe=69FDE779"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "3474397939524850", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974494_3474397942858183_7325370313459975246_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eRu0fRoTPP0Q7kNvwEQkguy&_nc_oc=Adp_SzwGm89MHBfYYFg90nIqVGPEp_tew-vpxhAmtgTvyyNK-CPAY2Gw_hYsuCbHXeA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6a1PomSQAbTz3rO_TMiPJo8EqHiJeC_Y2tyGr0dxL0ZQ&oe=69FDFE4B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hard Drive Logo (6).png", "id": "1060475455596738", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984476_1060475458930071_8663595066419356644_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UQmmgfTnt0QQ7kNvwGvVBBd&_nc_oc=AdpKRk17zkAhsQiT2DClMPRorSFRMJLQP-Gvz_4TgMAtyfV2GQllbsn3KVw6dUN2h8w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4AuTC8gIFvFKjUjGgDAWvtddHE7WySVSls-OFF4dKe5Q&oe=69FDFCCE"}, "display_name": "Hard Drive", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# *Hard Drive* \n\nHard Drive is a fast-paced, multiplayer, competitive electro combat driving game. Players control sleek, neon-lit motorcycle looking vehicles, known as bykes, which leave behind a temporary solid trail of light as they move. Players must outmaneuver their opponents by creating a trails of light that they cannot avoid crashing into, while avoiding the trails left by other players.\n\n# _Current Features_\n- Non PvP Driving Park\n- 6 Player Combat Arena\n- Season Pass with Progression Rewards\n- Cosmetic Shop \n\n## More Coming Soon. . .", "short_description": "Electro Combat Driving "}]}, "devel